{"articleNo":"2416","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2416&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010-1 타대학(안동대) 학생교류 수학 신청안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.01.17","hit":"15397","attachments":[{"name":"안동대수학허가신청서식.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2416&attachNo=1487"},{"name":"타대학수학신청원(2010).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2416&attachNo=1520"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -2pt; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">&nbsp;안동대학교 수학 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 16pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 16pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;국내 대학간 학술교류 및 학점인정에 관한 협정에 의거 </span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2010학년도 1학기 안동대학교 수학을 아래와 같이 안내합니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>1. 지원자격 : 아래의 각 호에 해당하는 자</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; <span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">가. 본교 재학생으로서 2개학기 이상을 이수한 자.</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; <span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 이수성적 평점평균이 3.0 이상인 자.</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>&nbsp; 다. 학칙에 의하여 징계 받은 사실이 없는 자.</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>2. 수학기간 : 타대학에서 2개 학기(1년) 이내로 수학 가능.</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>3. 제출서류 및 장소</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;<span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">가. 제출서류&nbsp;: 타대학 수학 신청원, 수학허가신청서(안동대학교)</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; 나. 제출장소 : 종합학사행정실 </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 신청기한 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2010. 1. 25(월)까지</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5. 수학기간 : 2010. 3. 2(화) ~ 6. 18(금)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;6. 등록금 납부 : 소속대학교에 납부</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;7. 수강신청 : 추천서류에 의거 안동대학교 학사관리과에서 일괄 신청.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;8. 개설과목 및 수업시간표 조회</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -60pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 60pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://haksa.andong.ac.kr:8080/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">안동대학교 홈페이지 종합정보시스템</span></a><a href=\"http://haksa.andong.ac.kr:8080/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">(</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">http://haksa.andong.ac.kr:8080/)</span></a><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">→ 손님으로 입장 → 개설교과목 조회 (2010학년도 1학기)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;9. 취득학점 </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학기당 18학점 이내</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;10. 학점인정 : 수학기간 중 취득한 학점은 우리대학교 학칙, 수강신청 및 성적처리에 </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;관한 규정 등에 의거 동일하게 처리한다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;11. 기타</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;◆&nbsp; 문의사항 : 안동대학교 학사관리과(054-820-7034)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">금오공과대학교 종합학사행정실 (각관 1층)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;